Restrict preview fetches to public addresses and cap the download size.

Upstream fetch_preview_bytes() requests any URL a client passes and reads the
whole response body into memory when the server ignores the Range header.
Route requests through PublicOnlyTransport (see net_guard.py), ignore proxy
environment variables (they would bypass the transport), limit redirects, and
stream the body, stopping once max_bytes have been read.

